                    <div class="col-4">
                        <strong>@(LangService.IsMyanmar ? "အခြေအနေ" : "Status"):</strong> @(SelectedMasterStatus == "All" ? (LangService.IsMyanmar ? "အားလုံး" : "All") : SelectedMasterStatus == "MasterEligible" ? (LangService.IsMyanmar ? "မဟာဘွဲ့ အရည်အချင်းပြည့်မီသူ" : "Master Eligible") : (LangService.IsMyanmar ? "ဘွဲ့ကြိုသာ ရရှိသူ" : "Bachelor Only"))
